{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"MarketMind Core API","description":"Orchestration service for MarketMind. Owns the product catalog, the coverage index (what data has already been collected and for which period), the deterministic indicator engine (Cap. 4) and the MOS engine (Cap. 5 — Entropy Weight + TOPSIS, computed per country, never aggregated across countries). Reads collection services' databases read-only and never writes to them. This service does NOT use LLMs to calculate or alter indicators, weights, or MOS — LLM use is limited to product identification (candidate text only) and explaining already-computed results.","version":"0.1.0"},"paths":{"/health":{"get":{"tags":["Health"],"summary":"Health Check","description":"Returns application status, own database connectivity, and read-only connectivity to the 4 collection services' databases (PyTrends, WorldBank, OECD, UNData).","operationId":"health_check_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"}}}}}}},"/coverage/check":{"post":{"tags":["Coverage"],"summary":"Check coverage (read-only)","description":"Reports which of the given gaps are already covered (fresh in coverage_index) without dispatching any collection. Callers that need to decide sync-vs-async handling before committing to a collection round-trip should call this first.","operationId":"check_coverage_coverage_check_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CoverageCheckRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CoverageCheckResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/jobs":{"post":{"tags":["Coverage"],"summary":"Check coverage and collect what's missing","description":"For each gap: skips it if already fresh, attaches to an in-flight task if another caller is already collecting the same gap (race dedup), or dispatches collection to the right sibling service and polls it to completion. Synchronous for Fase 1 — Fase 5 decides when this needs to move behind 202+SSE instead.","operationId":"create_job_jobs_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CreateJobRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/JobResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/jobs/{job_id}":{"get":{"tags":["Coverage"],"summary":"Get job status","description":"Polling endpoint for a job dispatched via POST /jobs.","operationId":"get_job_jobs__job_id__get","parameters":[{"name":"job_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Job Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/JobDetailResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/catalog/resolve":{"post":{"tags":["Catalog"],"summary":"Resolve product identity","description":"Resolves free-text product identification (already extracted by an upstream LLM step, out of scope here) to a stable entity_key: exact alias exato -> trigram fuzzy (arbitrado pelos excluded_terms) -> LLM -> nova entidade. entity_key is always generated locally and never blocked by an external dependency.","operationId":"resolve_catalog_resolve_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CatalogResolveRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CatalogResolveResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/catalog/identify-image":{"post":{"tags":["Catalog"],"summary":"Identify a product from a photo","description":"Synchronous, lightweight — one vision call (Claude), then resolves the identified product through the same Fase 2 pipeline as POST /catalog/resolve. Deliberately separate from POST /analyze: the frontend shows this result and lets the user correct any field (product_name, brand, category, target_age_min/max, estimated_price) before submitting the full analysis. estimated_price is the one field in this service that is an LLM guess, not sourced from a real API — never scored, context only.","operationId":"identify_image_catalog_identify_image_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/IdentifyImageRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/IdentifyImageResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/catalog/{entity_key}":{"get":{"tags":["Catalog"],"summary":"Get catalog entity","description":"Returns the entity and its aliases. merged_into is surfaced explicitly (not hidden) when this entity was merged into another — callers should follow it rather than treat the entity as current.","operationId":"get_entity_catalog__entity_key__get","parameters":[{"name":"entity_key","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Entity Key"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CatalogEntityResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/countries":{"get":{"tags":["Countries"],"summary":"Available analysis countries","description":"The markets available for analysis (those Google Ads can measure — see docs/paises-disponiveis.md), ordered by continent then name so the frontend can group + list them alphabetically directly from this order.","operationId":"list_countries_countries_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CountryItem"},"type":"array","title":"Response List Countries Countries Get"}}}}}}},"/indicators/compute":{"post":{"tags":["Indicators"],"summary":"Compute Cap. 4 indicators","description":"Computes every applicable indicator for a country (and, if entity_key is given, the 5 product-specific PyTrends indicators plus the conditional Median Age Fit too), normalizes each against normalization_reference, and upserts into indicator_values.","operationId":"compute_indicators_indicators_compute_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ComputeIndicatorsRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ComputeIndicatorsResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/mos/compute":{"post":{"tags":["MOS"],"summary":"Compute MOS (Cap. 5)","description":"Computes MOS for a product across the given countries, one independent result per country (never aggregated). Requires indicator_values (Fase 3) and calibrated dimension weights (POST /admin/mos/refresh-weights) for the resolved period_key to already exist — this endpoint does not trigger collection or calibration itself.","operationId":"compute_mos_mos_compute_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ComputeMosRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ComputeMosResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/analyze":{"post":{"tags":["Analyze"],"summary":"Analyze a product across countries (async)","description":"Resolves the product (Fase 2, same pipeline as POST /catalog/resolve and POST /catalog/identify-image), then returns a request_id immediately (202 Accepted) and processes everything else — ensuring the last 6 months of data freshness, computing Cap. 4 indicators, and computing the Cap. 5 MOS — in the background. Poll GET /analyze/{request_id} for the result, or subscribe to GET /analyze/{request_id}/stream (SSE) for live status. v1 uses FastAPI BackgroundTasks (no dedicated worker/queue yet) — if the API restarts mid-run, the request is left stuck in 'running'.","operationId":"analyze_analyze_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AnalyzeRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"202":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AnalyzeAcceptedResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/analyze/{request_id}":{"get":{"tags":["Analyze"],"summary":"Poll an analysis request","description":"result/breakdown are only populated once status == 'done'.","operationId":"get_analysis_analyze__request_id__get","parameters":[{"name":"request_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Request Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AnalysisStatusResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/analyze/{request_id}/stream":{"get":{"tags":["Analyze"],"summary":"Live status stream (SSE)","description":"Server-Sent Events stream of an analysis request's status. Emits a JSON event on every status change and closes once the request reaches a terminal state ('done' or 'failed'). Free push (no broker) — the server watches the DB row. Use EventSource in the browser.","operationId":"stream_analysis_analyze__request_id__stream_get","parameters":[{"name":"request_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Request Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/reconciliation/run":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Run coverage reconciliation","description":"Compares coverage_index against the 4 services' raw observation tables to catch drift. Low-priority/diagnostic — meant to be invoked periodically by an external cron/systemd timer, no in-process scheduler exists yet. See app/services/reconciliation_service.py for the exact scope (WorldBank/OECD/UNData only for Fase 1).","operationId":"run_reconciliation_admin_reconciliation_run_post","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReconciliationReportResponse"}}}}}}},"/admin/catalog/enrich-mid":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Best-effort google_mid enrichment","description":"For up to `limit` entities missing google_mid: asks PyTrends for suggestions on canonical_title and picks the best deterministic match. Never blocks catalog resolution — see app/services/enrichment_service.py.","operationId":"enrich_mid_admin_catalog_enrich_mid_post","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":20,"title":"Limit"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EnrichmentReportResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/catalog/backfill-terms":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Index the curated vocabulary of existing catalog entities","description":"Indexes every entity's `search_terms` as aliases and its `excluded_terms` as negative evidence. Both only run inside `resolve()`, so entities created before those features have neither. The two sides are always filled together: indexing only the positive terms turns on multilingual recall AND the merges the negative evidence exists to block. See app/db/models/product_excluded_term.py.","operationId":"backfill_terms_admin_catalog_backfill_terms_post","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BackfillTermsResponse"}}}}}}},"/admin/catalog/merge":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Merge duplicate catalog entities","description":"Merges entities discovered to share the same (enriched) google_mid. Run after /admin/catalog/enrich-mid — see app/services/merge_service.py.","operationId":"merge_catalog_admin_catalog_merge_post","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MergeReportResponse"}}}}}}},"/admin/mos/refresh-weights":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Calibrate MOS dimension weights (Rank Reciprocal)","description":"Writes all 6 dimension weights for the given period using Rank Reciprocal (RR) over an explicit priority order (Demand > Macro Demand Structure > Market Size > Economic Readiness > Digital Readiness > Demographic Sustainability) — Rank Order Centroid (ROC) was used from 2026-07-03 (replacing Entropy Weight, which live testing showed repeatedly undervaluing Demand) until 2026-07-08, when adding the Macro Demand Structure dimension prompted switching to RR to narrow the Market Size / Economic Readiness gap without hand-picking weights. Weights are fixed (no indicator data is read), but still versioned by period_key and never overwrite an already-closed period, consistent with normalization_reference. See app/services/mos/rank_reciprocal.py.","operationId":"refresh_weights_admin_mos_refresh_weights_post","parameters":[{"name":"period_key","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Period Key"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RefreshWeightsResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"AnalysisStatusResponse":{"properties":{"request_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","title":"Request Id"},"status":{"type":"string","title":"Status"},"canonical_title":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Canonical Title"},"brand":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Brand"},"category_title":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Category Title"},"user_prompt":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"User Prompt"},"result":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Result"},"explanation":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Explanation"},"breakdown":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Breakdown"},"error_message":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Error Message"}},"type":"object","required":["request_id","status","canonical_title","result","error_message"],"title":"AnalysisStatusResponse"},"AnalyzeAcceptedResponse":{"properties":{"request_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","title":"Request Id"},"status":{"type":"string","title":"Status"}},"type":"object","required":["request_id","status"],"title":"AnalyzeAcceptedResponse"},"AnalyzeRequest":{"properties":{"product_name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"title":"Product Name"},"brand":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Brand"},"category":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Category"},"localized_markets":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Localized Markets","description":"Per-COUNTRY curated search vocabulary from identify-image, keyed by ISO3 ({\"<ISO3>\": {primary_name, formal_name?, search_terms, excluded_terms, confidence}})."},"reference_candidates":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Reference Candidates","description":"Ranked shortlist of candidate biggest-markets from identify-image ([{country, primary_name, search_terms, excluded_terms, confidence}, ...]) — the largest by real search volume becomes the Demand Volume ruler ceiling."},"target_age_min":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Target Age Min"},"target_age_max":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Target Age Max"},"estimated_price":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Estimated Price"},"price_currency":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Price Currency"},"user_prompt":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"User Prompt","description":"The buyer's own free-text description/question (the same text used as the identify-image hint). Stored and passed to the final explanation LLM so it can answer what the user asked — strictly from the deterministic evidence, never inventing data."},"countries":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","minItems":1,"title":"Countries","description":"ISO3 country codes"}},"type":"object","required":["product_name","countries"],"title":"AnalyzeRequest"},"BackfillTermsResponse":{"properties":{"entidades":{"type":"integer","title":"Entidades"},"aliases":{"type":"integer","title":"Aliases"},"excluidos":{"type":"integer","title":"Excluidos"},"obsoletos":{"type":"integer","title":"Obsoletos","default":0}},"type":"object","required":["entidades","aliases","excluidos"],"title":"BackfillTermsResponse"},"CatalogEntityResponse":{"properties":{"entity_key":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","title":"Entity Key"},"canonical_title":{"type":"string","title":"Canonical Title"},"google_mid":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Google Mid"},"google_type":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Google Type"},"category":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Category"},"brand":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Brand"},"generic_entity_key":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Generic Entity Key"},"brands":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","title":"Brands","default":[]},"merged_into":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Merged Into"},"aliases":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProductAliasItem"},"type":"array","title":"Aliases"}},"type":"object","required":["entity_key","canonical_title","google_mid","google_type","category","merged_into","aliases"],"title":"CatalogEntityResponse"},"CatalogResolveRequest":{"properties":{"text":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"title":"Text"},"source":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"title":"Source"},"brand":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Brand"},"category":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Category"},"target_age_min":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Target Age Min"},"target_age_max":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Target Age Max"}},"type":"object","required":["text","source"],"title":"CatalogResolveRequest"},"CatalogResolveResponse":{"properties":{"entity_key":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","title":"Entity Key"},"canonical_title":{"type":"string","title":"Canonical Title"},"brand":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Brand"},"generic_title":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Generic Title","description":"Título da entidade-família (a categoria genérica) quando esta entidade é de uma marca. Nulo numa entidade genérica, que é a própria família."},"method":{"type":"string","title":"Method"},"match_score":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Match Score"}},"type":"object","required":["entity_key","canonical_title","method"],"title":"CatalogResolveResponse"},"ComputeIndicatorsRequest":{"properties":{"country":{"type":"string","maxLength":3,"minLength":3,"title":"Country","description":"ISO3 country code"},"entity_key":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Entity Key"},"period_key":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Period Key","description":"'YYYY-MM'; defaults to the current month"}},"type":"object","required":["country"],"title":"ComputeIndicatorsRequest"},"ComputeIndicatorsResponse":{"properties":{"results":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/IndicatorValueResponse"},"type":"array","title":"Results"}},"type":"object","required":["results"],"title":"ComputeIndicatorsResponse"},"ComputeMosRequest":{"properties":{"entity_key":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","title":"Entity Key"},"countries":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array","minItems":1,"title":"Countries","description":"ISO3 country codes"},"period_key":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Period Key","description":"'YYYY-MM'; defaults to the current month"}},"type":"object","required":["entity_key","countries"],"title":"ComputeMosRequest"},"ComputeMosResponse":{"properties":{"results":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MosResultResponse"},"type":"array","title":"Results"}},"type":"object","required":["results"],"title":"ComputeMosResponse"},"CountryItem":{"properties":{"iso3":{"type":"string","title":"Iso3"},"iso2":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Iso2"},"name":{"type":"string","title":"Name"},"continent":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Continent"}},"type":"object","required":["iso3","iso2","name","continent"],"title":"CountryItem","description":"One available analysis market. `continent` groups the frontend picker;\nthe list is returned ordered by (continent, name)."},"CoverageCheckRequest":{"properties":{"gaps":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CoverageGap"},"type":"array","minItems":1,"title":"Gaps"}},"type":"object","required":["gaps"],"title":"CoverageCheckRequest"},"CoverageCheckResponse":{"properties":{"results":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GapStatus"},"type":"array","title":"Results"}},"type":"object","required":["results"],"title":"CoverageCheckResponse"},"CoverageGap":{"properties":{"source":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DataSource"},"entity_key":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Entity Key"},"country":{"type":"string","maxLength":3,"minLength":3,"title":"Country","description":"ISO3 country code"},"indicator_code":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"title":"Indicator Code"},"period_key":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"title":"Period Key"},"is_closed":{"type":"boolean","title":"Is Closed","default":false},"ttl_days":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Ttl Days","description":"Overrides settings.default_coverage_ttl_days when set"},"collection_params":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Collection Params"},"force":{"type":"boolean","title":"Force","description":"Collect even when the coverage_index row is still fresh. Set by callers that detect staleness the keyword-agnostic coverage_index can't see (e.g. the per-country PyTrends series exists but for a different/old winning keyword) — see analysis_service.","default":false}},"type":"object","required":["source","country","indicator_code","period_key"],"title":"CoverageGap","description":"One unit of coverage the caller wants checked and, if missing,\ncollected. Maps 1:1 to a coverage_index row and, if collection is\nneeded, to exactly one job_task / one external ingestion run.\n\n``collection_params`` carries whatever the target source needs beyond\ncountry/indicator_code to build its request (e.g. ``keyword`` for\nPyTrends, ``start_year``/``end_year`` for WorldBank/UNData) — see\napp/services/collection_client.py for the exact keys per source. The\nCore does not resolve these from the product catalog yet (Fase 2), so\ncallers must supply them explicitly."},"CreateJobRequest":{"properties":{"requested_by":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Requested By"},"gaps":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CoverageGap"},"type":"array","minItems":1,"title":"Gaps"}},"type":"object","required":["gaps"],"title":"CreateJobRequest"},"DataSource":{"type":"string","enum":["pytrends","worldbank","oecd","undata"],"title":"DataSource"},"EnrichmentReportResponse":{"properties":{"checked":{"type":"integer","title":"Checked"},"enriched":{"type":"integer","title":"Enriched"},"no_match":{"type":"integer","title":"No Match"},"failed":{"type":"integer","title":"Failed"}},"type":"object","required":["checked","enriched","no_match","failed"],"title":"EnrichmentReportResponse"},"ExternalSourceStatus":{"properties":{"source":{"type":"string","title":"Source"},"status":{"type":"string","title":"Status"}},"type":"object","required":["source","status"],"title":"ExternalSourceStatus"},"GapStatus":{"properties":{"source":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DataSource"},"entity_key":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Entity Key"},"country":{"type":"string","title":"Country"},"indicator_code":{"type":"string","title":"Indicator Code"},"period_key":{"type":"string","title":"Period Key"},"covered":{"type":"boolean","title":"C